sequenceDiagram
    %% TrustChain-AI: Sequence Diagram — Telemetry Ingestion & Dynamic Trust Evaluation

    autonumber
    actor Agent as Autonomous Agent / Worker
    participant API as FastAPI /registry Router
    participant TelemSvc as Telemetry Service (telemetry.py)
    participant DB_Logs as SQLite (telemetry_logs)
    participant Engine as TrustEngine (trust_engine.py)
    participant DB_State as SQLite (agent_trust_states)
    participant DB_Audit as SQLite (trust_audit_trails)

    Agent->>API: POST /registry/telemetry (agent_did, task_id, success, compliance_event, latency_ms)
    API->>TelemSvc: record_telemetry(payload)
    
    TelemSvc->>DB_Logs: INSERT into telemetry_logs (id, agent_did, task_id, success, compliance, latency, timestamp)
    DB_Logs-->>TelemSvc: Event Persisted

    TelemSvc->>Engine: update_trust_for_agent(agent_did)
    Engine->>DB_Logs: SELECT last 10 telemetry records WHERE agent_did = agent_did ORDER BY timestamp DESC
    DB_Logs-->>Engine: 10 Historical Records [r_1, r_2, ..., r_n]

    Note over Engine: Calculate Sliding Window Factors (n <= 10)<br/>S_i(t) = sum(success) / n<br/>C_i(t) = sum(compliance == True) / n<br/>L_i(t) = min(avg(latency_ms) / 2000, 1.0)
    
    Engine->>Engine: Compute Composite Performance Score:<br/>P_i(t) = 0.6 * S_i(t) + 0.3 * C_i(t) + 0.1 * (1 - L_i(t))
    
    Engine->>DB_State: SELECT temporal_trust_score, trust_state FROM agent_trust_states WHERE did = agent_did
    DB_State-->>Engine: Prior State: T_i(t-1) [Default 1.0 if new]

    Engine->>Engine: Compute Exponential Moving Average (decay lambda = 0.7):<br/>T_i(t) = 0.7 * P_i(t) + 0.3 * T_i(t-1)

    Note over Engine: Classify New Trust State:<br/>- T >= 0.8  --> TRUSTED<br/>- 0.5 <= T < 0.8 --> SUSPICIOUS<br/>- T < 0.5  --> QUARANTINED<br/>*(If already REVOKED, retain REVOKED)*

    alt State Changed (e.g., TRUSTED -> SUSPICIOUS or SUSPICIOUS -> QUARANTINED)
        Engine->>DB_Audit: INSERT into trust_audit_trails (id, agent_did, previous_state, new_state, reason, timestamp)
        DB_Audit-->>Engine: Audit Trail Recorded
    end

    Engine->>DB_State: UPDATE agent_trust_states SET temporal_trust_score = T_i(t), trust_state = new_state, last_updated = now()
    DB_State-->>Engine: State Record Updated

    Engine-->>TelemSvc: TrustEvaluationResult(agent_did, P_i, T_i, trust_state, state_changed)
    TelemSvc-->>API: TelemetryResponse(status="recorded", metrics)
    API-->>Agent: HTTP 200 OK {status: "ok", trust_score: T_i(t), trust_state: state}
